WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:03.760
Luffy is a total idiot that&nbsp;
has no character development&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:07.120
whatsoever. Why do people&nbsp;
like a guy like that? - is&nbsp;&nbsp;

